<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Taiwan weighted index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Taiwan weighted index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 1.5 million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on a Taiwan weighted index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	12.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	21.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON (APPLIED)	MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $312.80  TW$27.62 PER US$1.0</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p>TYPE	  STRIKE	 ISSUE    B/E PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p>CALL	  275	    $50.15   3.90 PCT	  6.2 X</p>
<p>CALL	  300	    $34.60   6.97 PCT	  9.0 X</p>
<p>CALL	  325	    $22.70   11.2 PCT	  13.8 X</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
